<title>NEW ZEALAND: Blue Star buys family stake in McCollam.</title>
<headline>Blue Star buys family stake in McCollam.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Star Office Technology Limited, part of the U.S. Office Products Co vehicle due to bid for New Zealand's McCollam Printers Ltd, said on Thursday it had increased its voting stake to over 58 percent from about 20 percent by buying shares from family holders.</p>
<p>In a statement to the New Zealand Stock Exchange the company said it had paid the equivalent of NZ$3.00 a share for just over 9.0 million McCollam shares, to be settled by US Office Products Co common stock.</p>
</text>
